  endingTitle: Heath_Hunger
  titleDA: Sult
  descriptionDA: "\xC5h nej! Pandaen kunne ikke finde bambus nok at spise. Den blev
    for sulten og svag til at forts\xE6tte.\n\nN\xE5r du bes\xF8ger zoologisk have,
    st\xF8tter du et avlsprogram, der er med til at beskytte k\xE6mpepandaer! \r\n\r\nOg
    n\xE5r du k\xF8ber bambusprodukter, s\xE5 kig efter FSC-m\xE6rket. Det hj\xE6lper
    dig med at v\xE6lge produkter, der er lavet med omtanke for skovene og dyrelivet.  "
  titleEN: Hunger
  descriptionEN: "Oh no! The panda couldn't find enough bamboo to eat. It got too
    hungry and weak to keep going.\n\nWhen you visit the zoo, you support a breeding
    program that helps protect giant pandas! \r\n\r\nAnd when you buy bamboo products,
    look for the FSC label. It helps you choose products made with care for forests
    and wildlife.  "
